{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1000_p", "source_sha256": "14da3fdb65e905f1d416682a23ec6989f563983dc012b8b8783f2695cfbd9dcb", "ja": "（元気にPV撮影を終えた翼。帰るために着替え……\nるのかと思いきや、笑顔でそのままこちらへ来た）", "zh": "（翼精神十足地拍完了PV。本以为她要换好衣服再回去……没想到她面带笑容，就这样朝我走了过来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "93d86f6f32021107066d09728184471431c9f283e1a57e17424dc59b4978b60b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまで～す！\nわたし、今日はいっぱい頑張ったんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～！\n我今天可是努力了好多，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "83cc515f7f54c8bea86e88b5ea71eada2cd60ca68ebfeb2e022e4946775c9bc7", "ja": "もうちょっとだけ、頑張っちゃおうかなって思ってて♪\nなにをしようとしてるのか、わかりますか？", "zh": "我还想着再稍微努力一下呢♪\n您猜得出我想做什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1003_p", "source_sha256": "923f8ec8cb748e1acf62cb25994507111e33858fe35ee224485bb2b090f68e21", "ja": "うーん……そうだなぁ。\nもしかして、いつものご褒美関係かな？", "zh": "嗯……这个嘛。\n难道是要准备平时的奖励之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "440d3043e897f31af81c4b7d0e3766e3ec9b13a97d0030c021eadd1844f08d4b", "ja": "ぶっぶー！　正解は……\n{$P$}さんへおねだりしにきました♪", "zh": "错啦——！正确答案是……来向{$P$}先生撒娇求东西♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1005_p", "source_sha256": "742e56c2791a8bf2e6659b2cc627158018c9eff2db42fa7e5fde0b0e9aa87d48", "ja": "おねだり……は、ご褒美と違うのか？", "zh": "撒娇……不就是奖励吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00facb7018bc1d3f85fa066b1e234c8b028f1802a0b129ff8a270cd5485c8d01", "ja": "違いますよ～！　このPVの曲って、わたしが\n初めてセンター公演をした時の曲じゃないですか。", "zh": "不是哦～！这支PV的歌，不就是我第一次担任中心公演时唱的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b555a863beccd60d9ff3a946775d72864b672e8ad7503b3bd593d0d00a4d2fa", "ja": "それからいろんなお仕事をして、\nあの頃よりは成長したって思ってるけど……。", "zh": "之后也做了各种各样的工作，我觉得自己比那时候成长了不少，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "88011c3c9e81b9483d52ca33c43371487da0f9a4e50d4e2a99c0f36699c410aa", "ja": "{$P$}さんには、\n今のわたしがどう見えてるのか、気になって。", "zh": "我就很想知道，在{$P$}先生眼里，\n现在的我是什么样子的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1fa246cba27f324fd3aec2228d9ff211e99aef330b21befd639d3eae04828b39", "ja": "どう見えてるか、か……。\n俺は、すごく成長したと思ってるよ。", "zh": "你觉得我是怎样的啊……我觉得，你真的成长了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1010_p", "source_sha256": "921464c1e68aa526c74b55021151789ec4974be0f6498ddf211ef7a71dc1c05c", "ja": "実力がついたというよりは、大人に近づいてるように\n思うよ。それに前よりアイドルを楽しんでるなって。", "zh": "与其说是实力变强了，我倒觉得你变得更像个\n大人了。而且也比以前更享受当偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a5b5a0fdd0b3509781204defd28262370ef8b1ac77ef79261829391a9db3b49", "ja": "えへへ、当然ですよ！　だって、楽しいもん♪\n劇場のみんなにも負けたくないし……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，那当然啦！因为很开心嘛♪\n我也不想输给剧场里的大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "70cd88d48346bdeeb113d1d5a6590af7e9facf0870337b410d3565fbe73076eb", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、いっぱい応援してくれる……それに\n{$P$}さんも褒めてくれますし♪", "zh": "粉丝们也会一直为我加油……而且，{$P$}先生也会夸我嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5119b01448e66d09ec0424ee7fa5ed93ae6e98f759691fd4bb89a2c0f561e28d", "ja": "ああ。そういう翼の気持ちが、\n最近はより強く伝わってくる気がするよ。", "zh": "啊。我觉得，翼的这份心意，最近也越来越能真切地感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1014_p", "source_sha256": "13d198c809c93986b171d32e379bdf3067bea51e1ffb11a1d86c297cde6c7a85", "ja": "ちゃんと仕事もしてくれるから、\n今はあまり心配してないんだ。頼もしい限りだよ。", "zh": "因为你也一直认真工作，\n所以我现在已经不怎么担心了。真是让人放心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2800ba917eb228b8b5619706bbe4993f798fb2a445294b034fcc8f0c9d44f392", "ja": "ほんとですか？　えへへっ……じゃあ、\nそろそろ『初級編』は卒業ってことですね♪", "zh": "真的吗？　嘿嘿……那么，\n差不多该从“初级篇”毕业了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ee59e769723513eb523e55171ed65ba36b594ec79d7961fb3ecdf4c8322136d9", "ja": "ん？　初級編って何のだ？", "zh": "嗯？“初级篇”是指什么的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1ae5e81382ca0e63510374ccfd0f0bb89a01bde2702ee9dd0e306173feb8aac8", "ja": "何って、アイドルのですよ。アイドルの『初級編』！\n次は……『中級編』ですかね？", "zh": "当然是偶像的。偶像的“初级篇”！\n接下来……该是“中级篇”了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1018_p", "source_sha256": "214197ebea04e92bbe18c29ca672dda473c755b979d3084e18178bc9894fdc40", "ja": "アイドルの中級編ってなんだ？", "zh": "偶像的“中级篇”是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "93b0c32548a8f021e838b037fffadbdacd9dbe1c1df55c2ebfbc9c845e866dce", "ja": "んー……なんでしょうね？\nもっとモテモテになっちゃうお仕事とか……。", "zh": "嗯～……会是什么呢？\n比如让人变得更受欢迎的工作之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ae23431a287f9f5c4e4a623fca0e4d0d67c41808d7f79c77861ba8a38ed940ba", "ja": "今よりもーっと大人っぽいお仕事とか？\nよくわかんないけど、とにかく頑張りまーす♪", "zh": "比如比现在更加成熟的工作？  \n虽然不太明白，总之我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c073352e6480e5e78f3dedbee58d2dc66dbb0317a03b2710d48468fcfeeb6074", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、もっと大胆に\nアピールしたり、今まで以上のことをしていきますね！", "zh": "我也要对{$P$}先生展开更大胆的\n攻势，做更多超越以往的事哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1022_p", "source_sha256": "af6748895be4f5d37cf144a5c99b85afdd507d070fd89d68891b2f69a7ade9fe", "ja": "……ん？　今のはアイドルの話、だよな？", "zh": "……嗯？刚才说的是当偶像的事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b2ac4891a78c009a98c17c5f7545f72cd8e47cb2bc7bfc6ad58350d513c24232", "ja": "えへへ♪　わたし、どんどん成長しますから！\nしっかり受けとめてくださいね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我会不断成长的！\n请好好接住我的成长哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0744_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0744_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8c694967e679a760dcbf8b844be861522f8878cd4b68df137d64ec12d6ff1c7f", "ja": "（初級編の次は、中級、そして上級へと続いていく。\n常にマイペースな翼だが、成長は止まらないはずだ！）", "zh": "（初级篇之后还有中级篇，然后是高级篇。虽然翼总是按照自己的节奏来，但她的成长应该不会停止！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
